@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.34.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.34.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.34.0 (2026-11-24): The two new deliverables of scope change SC11_RepeatsWindows are groomed into one story each, with an acceptance criterion and two tasks (build, verify). Honest note: the first build files of both stories (deck 4.2.0 and 4.3.0, story companion 1.1.0, source versions, Windows set-up) were committed before this grooming record; the register was late for those files and is brought level here."""@en .

ex:AC11_Repeats_10 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The story repeat check over chapters 1 to 25 finds no repeat of a chapter 10 story, the deck keeps its slide count of 41, and the deck checks, the code check and the page test pass."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:ST11_Repeats_10 a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10: no story repeats another chapter's story"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready ;
    backlog:appliesDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD11 ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC11_Repeats_10 ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK11_Repeats_10_Build, ex:TK11_Repeats_10_Verify .
ex:TK11_Repeats_10_Build a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Replace the UTF-8 and JSON stories by two new stories with real pictures and a live link in the deck, the story companion and the page"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK11_Repeats_10_Verify a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Run the story repeat check, the deck checks and the page test, read the logs"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Verify ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_Repeats_10_Build .
ex:AC11_Windows a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "Every example, result and Try it run of chapters 10 and 11 shows Windows paths by a hidden set-up, results may span several lines, and the deck checks, the code check and both page tests pass."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:ST11_Windows a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Chapters 10 and 11: Windows is the default platform"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready ;
    backlog:appliesDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD11 ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC11_Windows ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK11_Windows_Build, ex:TK11_Windows_Verify .
ex:TK11_Windows_Build a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Add the hidden Windows set-up to both sources and all Try it set-ups, rebuild decks, A-boxes and pages"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK11_Windows_Verify a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Run the deck checks, the code check and the full page tests, read the logs"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Verify ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_Windows_Build .
